exists su name base_prefix ob text "meeting-qwen-auto" be default ya
exists su name focus ob text "the main topics, evidence, decisions, and next steps discussed in the agenda, using a neutral, source-faithful lens" be default ya
exists su name jurisdiction ob text "Grey County" be default ya
exists su name body ob text "auto" be default ya
exists su name site_url ob text "https://helpos.ca" be default ya
exists su name discussion_url ob text "" be default ya
ob text text meeting_ref be input ya

su name sandbox configure be map def
su name timeout ms ob num 28800000 ya
su name max output bytes ob num 16777216 ya
prah

ob text "PYA_COMMAND_TIMEOUT_MS=28800000 node /home/htaf/pyac/pyash/world/house/grey-county-reporter/program/run-grey-county-meeting-from-ref.mjs \"" to name cmd be text do
ob name text meeting_ref to name cmd be plus do
ob text "\" \"" to name cmd be plus do
ob name text base_prefix to name cmd be plus do
ob text "\" \"" to name cmd be plus do
ob name text focus to name cmd be plus do
ob text "\" \"" to name cmd be plus do
ob name text jurisdiction to name cmd be plus do
ob text "\" \"" to name cmd be plus do
ob name text body to name cmd be plus do
ob text "\" \"" to name cmd be plus do
ob name text site_url to name cmd be plus do
ob text "\" \"" to name cmd be plus do
ob name text discussion_url to name cmd be plus do
ob text "\"" to name cmd be plus do

ob text of ob of cmd to name text out be command do
ob name out be write do
